    {
      "subId": "7610109",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the control room",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761010901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761010901": {
            "id": "761010901",
            "speakerId": 7180,
            "speakerName": "Nikita",
            "text": "Good work, everyone. Let's set our duties aside for now. Rest well."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7610110",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the control room",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761011001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761011001": {
            "id": "761011001",
            "speakerId": 22320,
            "speakerName": "Olav",
            "text": "Moments like this are rare. Ever since the old man made me squad leader, these gatherings are the only time I really get to catch up with the guys."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7610111",
      "subQuestName": "Destroy the Cataclysm Egg",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761011101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761011101": {
            "id": "761011101",
            "speakerId": 22320,
            "speakerName": "Olav",
            "text": "Stop dallying. The Starshyna is waiting for you at the great mead hall."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7610113",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Illuga",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761011301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761011301": {
            "id": "761011301",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "The gate to the bedeviled sky is open, and still you cling to that puny pittance of kuuvahki as if it matters?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011302"
            ]
          },
          "761011302": {
            "id": "761011302",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "Yet... How am I still trapped here? Ah, I see... The Sampo Mill turns its face from me once more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011303"
            ]
          },
          "761011303": {
            "id": "761011303",
            "speakerId": 22199,
            "speakerName": "Alia",
            "text": "Well, well, look who finally showed up. What an honor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011304"
            ]
          },
          "761011304": {
            "id": "761011304",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "...Who's there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011305"
            ]
          },
          "761011305": {
            "id": "761011305",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "This form... Relya? Ah, there you are. I knew you were still alive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011306"
            ]
          },
          "761011306": {
            "id": "761011306",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "Now, bend the Sampo Mill's power to my will! You will succeed, with the sacred heir's blood burning inside you... Those other three were laughable failures, but not you, no. You've always been my chosen one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011307"
            ]
          },
          "761011307": {
            "id": "761011307",
            "speakerId": 22199,
            "speakerName": "Alia",
            "text": "Ha... He really thinks I'm Relya. So the mad monk who could once talk his way out of anything can't even see straight now. How ironic.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011308"
            ]
          },
          "761011308": {
            "id": "761011308",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "Relya, do not waver. You haven't forgotten our dream, have you? Don't you want to claim the name and the place that were always meant to be yours?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011309"
            ]
          },
          "761011309": {
            "id": "761011309",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "Picture it — an Elysium for the shamed and forgotten, a place where the proud fae nobles sink to their knees before you. And in this royal court of the Pale Star, only I, another human, can make that vision yours.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011310"
            ]
          },
          "761011310": {
            "id": "761011310",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "And now I stand just one step from the star-bound ascent... When the Elysium beyond the heavens unfolds upon this world, all others will be swept aside, leaving only us, the chosen few, to inherit what remains.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011311"
            ]
          },
          "761011311": {
            "id": "761011311",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "When that dawn comes, all the rot of this age will be washed away. Tell me, is that not the world you always hoped for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011312"
            ]
          },
          "761011312": {
            "id": "761011312",
            "speakerId": 22199,
            "speakerName": "Alia",
            "text": "No. That future was never his desire... And how could you still be peddling the same lie at a time like this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011313"
            ]
          },
          "761011313": {
            "id": "761011313",
            "speakerId": 22199,
            "speakerName": "Alia",
            "text": "You were using him from the very start. Every promise, every lie, you spun them all to make him seize the Sampo Mill for you. And that \"Elysium\" you keep preaching about? It was only ever meant for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011314"
            ]
          },
          "761011314": {
            "id": "761011314",
            "speakerId": 22199,
            "speakerName": "Alia",
            "text": "Even his fall from rank, the path that turned him into a thief, that too was a trap you devised alongside Grand Duke Alvis. All of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011315"
            ]
          },
          "761011315": {
            "id": "761011315",
            "speakerId": 22321,
            "speakerName": "\"The Professor\"",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011316"
            ]
          },
          "761011316": {
            "id": "761011316",
            "speakerId": 22199,
            "speakerName": "Alia",
            "text": "You might have called me Relya by mistake, but it suits me all the same. I carry his role and legacy, and the name Reed Miller is one I will take without hesitation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011317"
            ]
          },
          "761011317": {
            "id": "761011317",
            "speakerId": 22199,
            "speakerName": "Alia",
            "text": "Rauthvangi. Mad monk. \"Professor.\" Undying serpent... Your story ends here. I will end it in Reed Miller's name.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011318"
            ]
          },
          "761011318": {
            "id": "761011318",
            "speakerId": 1324,
            "speakerName": "Illuga",
            "text": "We really did it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011319"
            ]
          },
          "761011319": {
            "id": "761011319",
            "speakerId": 1324,
            "speakerName": "Illuga",
            "text": "That undying fiend is well and truly buried...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011320"
            ]
          },
          "761011320": {
            "id": "761011320",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "\"Twice shall that undying serpent rise again, but thrice shall he be struck down... And at last shall he be laid to rest by the heroes of the sublunary sphere...\"\\nStanding alongside the courageous Ratniki, you defeat the \"Professor\" at long last...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761011321"
            ]
          },
          "761011321": {
            "id": "761011321",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "For several days afterward, you stay in Piramida..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
